            </note>
            <note corresp="#d257-f2" n="2" xml:id="d257-f2-content">
                <p>Young’s letter is not printed; it transmitted the study on U.S. policy toward
                    Cambodia submitted to Bowie by McClintock under cover of <ref target="#d255"
                        >Document 255</ref>. The study is not printed. (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Ibid.</hi>)</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d257-f3" n="3" xml:id="d257-f3-content">
                <p>Attached but not printed.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
